        <div class="prose fade-in">
            <h2>The situation</h2>
            <p>Gateway's Galaxy ticketing platform is used by major visitor attractions internationally. It was designed in the US — but for UK museums and heritage organisations, memberships and annual passes paid by Direct Debit are a core income stream.</p>
            <p>Elephas has worked with Gateway's UK business since 2017, filling UK-specific requirements like this with integrations, plugins and companion apps.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="fade-in">What we did</h2>
        <ul class="checklist">
            <li class="fade-in">A secure payment page that validates bank details and sets up Direct Debit mandates</li>
            <li class="fade-in">Plugins for Galaxy's web store, tills and payment-plan processing, so Direct Debit works wherever a membership is sold</li>
            <li class="fade-in">A webhook listener that updates membership status as payments succeed or fail</li>
            <li class="fade-in">A background service that schedules collections with the right working-day lead times, monthly or quarterly</li>
            <li class="fade-in">A rebuild of the integration when the Direct Debit provider changed from Rapidata to Access Paysuite</li>
            <li class="fade-in">Tesco voucher redemption at the till, and Gift Aid workarounds</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</section>

